  "description": "Install new bin store on West View amenity land, adjacent to site boundary, for all occupants of the building. New area of hard standing, level with adjacent footpath, to suit required bin store capacity and access. 1200mm high timber enclosure to rear and sides of bins. Enclosure formed of timber uprights and hit and miss slatted panels. Cut back approx. 2.5 linear metre section of hedgerow to north boundary. Rebuild damaged section of front wall, height to match existing, in masonry to match. Create new opening in boundary wall, forming new pedestrian access to footpath, with metal gate opening on to site. Gate to be secured by FB2 key and lock for use by waste collection staff.",
